  "description": {
   "en": "Seo In's family, once forced to flee to the U.S. after discovering that the greatest threat to their lives was terrifyingly close, returns to Korea after seven years—only to be targeted once more. This time, Seo In is determined not to run. He decides to take everything from those who wronged them and sets out on a path of revenge.\n\nHis journey leads him to Jayden Taylor, the arrogant and powerful man at the helm of Teres Corporation. Jayden is unapologetically cold and dismissive of Seo In’s desperation, but instead of being discouraged, Seo In’s resolve only intensifies.\n\nBut the more Seo In tries to get what he wants from Jayden, the more Jayden begins to take root in his mind. What began as revenge starts shifting into something much more dangerous and complicated…"
  },
